(text "POWER: Laptop USB powers Arduino. Arduino 5V powers HC-SR04. External regulated 5V bank powers ALL servos." (at 185 115 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)))
(text "IMPORTANT: Arduino GND and power-bank GND must connect. DO NOT join power-bank +5V to Arduino 5V." (at 185 124 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)))
(text "Servo connector pin numbers are logical labels, not manufacturer-specific connector pinouts. Verify polarity before connecting." (at 185 133 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)))
(text "Arduino block is a functional pin map, not a PCB footprint or a complete Arduino shield schematic." (at 185 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)))
